#: ../../chapter04.rst:3
msgid "Advanced Topics"
msgstr "Avancerede emner"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:8
msgid "Connect Your File Server"
msgstr "Forbind din filserver"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:10
msgid ""
"The way to connect the file servers are different, depending on where the"
" file server is."
msgstr "Måden at forbinde filserverne på er forskellig, afhængig af hvor filserveren er."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:12
msgid ""
"The file server can be sitting in the same Local Area Network (LAN) as "
"the CentreStack Server. In this case, the direct network share connection"
" is the best. Usually, this is combined with setting up a direct LDAP "
"connection to the Active Directory."
msgstr "Filserveren kan være placeret i det samme lokale netværk (LAN) som CentreStack-serveren. I dette tilfælde er en direkte netværksdelingsforbindelse det bedste. Normalt kombineres dette med oprettelse af en direkte LDAP-forbindelse til Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:19
msgid "FILE SERVER CONNECTION"
msgstr "FILE SERVER FORBINDELSE"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:21
msgid ""
"The file server can also be remote, away from the CentreStack server and "
"at the customer's premise. In this case, the best is to use a file server"
" agent. File server agent will be installed on the file server, and it is"
" capable of connecting the customer's Active Directory and syncing both "
"folder content and active directory over HTTPS. In this case, in the user"
" interface, you will see \"Proxied AD User\" to indicate that the Active "
"Directory user or group is coming from the file server agent."
msgstr "Filen serveren kan også være fjern, væk fra CentreStack serveren og på kundens lokation. I dette tilfælde er det bedst at bruge en filserver agent. Filserver agenten vil blive installeret på filserveren, og den er i stand til at forbinde kundens Active Directory og synkronisere både mappeindhold og active directory over HTTPS. I dette tilfælde vil du i brugergrænsefladen se \"Proxied AD User\" for at indikere, at Active Directory brugeren eller gruppen kommer fra filserver agenten."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:26
msgid "SERVER AGENT CONNECTION"
msgstr "SERVERAGENTFORBINDELSE"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:29
msgid ""
"The best way to start using a file server agent to connect to a remote "
"file server is to start with the migration wizard from the web portal."
msgstr "Den bedste måde at begynde at bruge en filserveragent til at forbinde til en fjern filserver på er at starte med migreringsguiden fra webportalen."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:34
msgid "TEAM FOLDER STORAGE LOCATIONS"
msgstr "TEAM MAPPELAGRINGSPLACERINGER"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:39
msgid "Files and Folder Permission"
msgstr "Filer og mappe tilladelser"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:41
msgid ""
"If your files and folders are on a file server in the same Local Area "
"Network (LAN) as the CentreStack server, the best way to manage file and "
"folder permission is to delegate it 100% to the NTFS permission. In the "
"\"Storage Manager\", when attaching local storage, there is an option "
"\"Always access the storage using logon user identity\", This option can "
"be used to delegate file/folder permission check directly to NTFS."
msgstr "Hvis dine filer og mapper er på en filserver i det samme lokale netværk (LAN) som CentreStack-serveren, er den bedste måde at administrere fil- og mappe tilladelser på at delegere det 100% til NTFS-tilladelsen. I \"Storage Manager\", når du tilknytter lokal lagring, er der en mulighed \"Altid adgang til lagringen ved hjælp af logon brugeridentitet\", Denne mulighed kan bruges til at delegere fil/mappe tilladelseskontrol direkte til NTFS."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:46
msgid "FILE AND FOLDER PERMISSIONS SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER FOR FIL- OG MAPPEBERETTIGELSER"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:48
msgid ""
"If you are not using native NTFS permission. For example, you are on "
"cloud storage services such as Amazon S3 or OpenStack Swift, you can use "
"CentreStack folder permission."
msgstr "Hvis du ikke bruger native NTFS-tilladelser. For eksempel, hvis du er på cloud lagringstjenester som Amazon S3 eller OpenStack Swift, kan du bruge CentreStack mappe tilladelse."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:53
msgid "MANAGE FOLDER SETTINGS"
msgstr "HÅNDTÉR MAPPEINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:58
msgid "Setting up Active Directory"
msgstr "Opsætning af Active Directory"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:60
msgid ""
"When the Active Directory is in the Local Area Network (LAN), LDAP can be"
" used to connect to the Active Directory. There are several cases here,"
msgstr "Når Active Directory er i det lokale netværk (LAN), kan LDAP bruges til at forbinde til Active Directory. Der er flere tilfælde her,"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:63
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want the user account to be automatically provisioned so it"
" is easy for the administrator."
msgstr "Nogle gange ønsker du, at brugerkontoen skal oprettes automatisk, så det er nemt for administratoren."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:64
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want the user account to be limited to a specific AD group,"
" but still automatically provision the user's account when the users are "
"in the AD group."
msgstr "Nogle gange ønsker du, at brugerkontoen skal være begrænset til en specifik AD-gruppe, men stadig automatisk oprette brugerens konto, når brugerne er i AD-gruppen."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:65
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want the user account to be limited to a specific "
"Organization Unit."
msgstr "Nogle gange ønsker du, at brugerkontoen skal være begrænset til en specifik organisationsenhed."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:69
msgid "AD account auto provision"
msgstr "AD-konto automatisk provisionering"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:71
msgid "This is the default setting in the Settings -> Active Directory Settings."
msgstr "Dette er standardindstillingen i Indstillinger -> Indstillinger for Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:73
msgid ""
"As long as the \"Don't allow user auto-creation\" is not checked, Active "
"Directory users will be allowed to go to the web portal and log in. The "
"first time the user logs in, its CentreStack account will be "
"automatically provisioned."
msgstr "Så længe \"Tillad ikke automatisk oprettelse af brugere\" ikke er markeret, vil Active Directory-brugere have lov til at gå til webportalen og logge ind. Første gang brugeren logger ind, vil dennes CentreStack-konto automatisk blive oprettet."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:78
msgid "USER AUTO-CREATION SETTING"
msgstr "BRUGER AUTOMATISK OPRETTELSESINDSTILLING"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:82
msgid "AD account auto provision, limiting to Organization Unit"
msgstr "AD-konto automatisk provisionering, begrænset til organisationsenhed"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:84
msgid ""
"The organization unit field can be used to further limit the Active "
"Directory user account that can be automatically provisioned."
msgstr "Organisationsenhedsfeltet kan bruges til yderligere at begrænse den Active Directory-brugerkonto, der kan provisioneres automatisk."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:89
msgid "LIMIT TO ORGANIZATION UNIT SETTING"
msgstr "BEGRÆNS TIL ORGANISATIONSENHEDSINDSTILLING"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:91
msgid ""
"The format of the organization unit is the OU's distinguishedName minus "
"the DC suffix."
msgstr "Formatet på organisationsenheden er OU's distinguishedName minus DC-suffikset."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:93
msgid ""
"For example, the following OU's property is: distinguishedName       =>"
"      OU=tenant11,DC=tsys,DC=gladinet,DC=com"
msgstr "For eksempel er følgende OUs egenskab: distinguishedName       =>      OU=tenant11,DC=tsys,DC=gladinet,DC=com"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:96
msgid ""
"When it is put into the OU field, the DC suffix can be removed so only "
"OU=tenant11 is required."
msgstr "Når det indsættes i OU-feltet, kan DC-suffikset fjernes, så kun OU=tenant11 er nødvendig."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:99
msgid "OU=tenant11"
msgstr "OU=tenant11"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:104
msgid "OU PROPERTY LOCATION"
msgstr "OU EJENDOMSPLACERING"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:108
msgid "AD account auto provision, limiting to a specific AD group."
msgstr "Automatisk oprettelse af AD-konto, begrænset til en specifik AD-gruppe."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:110
msgid ""
"From the user manager, you can import the AD group and the users in the "
"AD group will be able to get the account automatically provisioned."
msgstr "Fra brugeradministratoren kan du importere AD-gruppen, og brugerne i AD-gruppen vil automatisk kunne få kontoen oprettet."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:115
msgid "MIGRATING USERS FROM ACTIVE DIRECTORY"
msgstr "MIGRERING AF BRUGERE FRA ACTIVE DIRECTORY"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:117
msgid "Here is a demo video for Import AD group."
msgstr "Her er en demovideo for import af AD-gruppe."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:126
msgid "Setting up Offline Folder"
msgstr "Opsætning af Offline-mappe"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:128
msgid ""
"In a team collaboration environment, there are several best practices "
"related to offline folder management."
msgstr "I et samarbejdsmiljø for hold er der flere bedste praksisser relateret til offline mappehåndtering."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:130
msgid "Here are  several parameters for consideration:"
msgstr "Her er flere parametre til overvejelse:"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:134
msgid "Team Folder Offline Settings"
msgstr "Team Mappe Offline Indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:136
msgid ""
"If you have a big team folder or several team folders that are quite big,"
" it is not a good practice to enable the team folder offline from the "
"root. Instead, you can choose not to enable offline or just enable a "
"subset of sub-folders that are relatively small and at the same time, "
"used more often. If you want to enable a subset of sub-folders within "
"team folders for offline access, you can start by going to the folder "
"permission section. You can access this by clicking the \"Team Folders\" "
"**(1)** from left side menu. \"Edit\" **(2)** the selected folder. In the"
" \"Folder Permissions\" tab of editing window, select \"Force offline "
"cache on native Client\" **(3)**, and apply the change."
msgstr "Hvis du har en stor teammappe eller flere teammapper, der er ret store, er det ikke god praksis at aktivere teammappen til offline brug fra roden. I stedet kan du vælge ikke at aktivere offline eller kun aktivere et subset af undermapper, der er relativt små og samtidig bruges oftere. Hvis du ønsker at aktivere et subset af undermapper inden for teammapper til offline adgang, kan du starte med at gå til sektionen for mappe tilladelser. Du kan få adgang til dette ved at klikke på \"Team Mapper\" **(1)** fra venstre side menu. \"Rediger\" **(2)** den valgte mappe. I fanen \"Mappe Tilladelser\" i redigeringsvinduet, vælg \"Tving offline cache på native Client\" **(3)**, og anvend ændringen."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:141
msgid "ENABLING OFFLINE ACCESS FOR NATIVE CLIENT"
msgstr "AKTIVERING AF OFFLINEADGANG FOR NATIV KLIENT"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:143
msgid ""
"If you want to disable offline access for the team folder completely, you"
" can change the setting from the Team Folders section by choosing the "
"\"Settings\" tab below **(1)** in the edit team folder window, and "
"selecting the \"Disable Offline Access\" option **(2)**. Don't forget to "
"save your changes **(3)**."
msgstr "Hvis du ønsker at deaktivere offline adgang for teammappen helt, kan du ændre indstillingen fra sektionen Teammapper ved at vælge fanen \"Indstillinger\" nedenfor **(1)** i rediger teammappe vinduet, og vælge muligheden \"Deaktiver Offline Adgang\" **(2)**. Glem ikke at gemme dine ændringer **(3)**."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:148
msgid "DISABLING OFFLINE ACCESS FOR TEAMSHARE"
msgstr "DEAKTIVERING AF OFFLINEADGANG FOR TEAMSHARE"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:152
msgid "User Offline Settings"
msgstr "Bruger Offline Indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:154
msgid ""
"Upon creating users in the CentreStack system (including users imported "
"from Active Directory), there is an offline flag upon user creation."
msgstr "Når du opretter brugere i CentreStack-systemet (inklusive brugere importeret fra Active Directory), er der et offline flag ved oprettelse af brugeren."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:156
msgid ""
"Normally, we don't recommend checking the \"Enable offline access for all"
" folders\" flag, because it will try to download every single file for "
"the user when the user is connected, which can use a lot of bandwidth and"
" slow things down."
msgstr "Normalt anbefaler vi ikke at markere afkrydsningsfeltet \"Aktivér offlineadgang for alle mapper\", fordi det vil forsøge at downloade hver eneste fil for brugeren, når brugeren er forbundet, hvilket kan bruge meget båndbredde og sænke hastigheden."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:161
msgid "ENABLING PER-USER OFFLINE ACCESS"
msgstr "AKTIVERING AF OFFLINEADGANG PR. BRUGER"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:165
msgid ""
"This will automatically download ALL folders and files to the user's "
"device and automatically update them whenever they have changed anywhere "
"in the network. This will cause a significant increase in network "
"traffic, especially during the initial download of all folders."
msgstr "Dette vil automatisk downloade ALLE mapper og filer til brugerens enhed og automatisk opdatere dem, når de ændres et sted i netværket. Dette vil forårsage en betydelig stigning i netværkstrafikken, især under den første download af alle mapper."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:167
msgid ""
"Without it, the user can still pick and choose which folder to mark as "
"offline."
msgstr "Uden det kan brugeren stadig vælge, hvilken mappe der skal markeres som offline."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:171
msgid "User Manual Offline Settings"
msgstr "Brugermanual Offline Indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:173
msgid ""
"During regular usage of the files and folders, users can mark folders as "
"offline."
msgstr "Under almindelig brug af filer og mapper kan brugere markere mapper som offline."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:178
msgid "ENABLE OFFLINE ACCESS AT THE CLIENT LEVEL"
msgstr "AKTIVÉR OFFLINEADGANG PÅ KLIENTNIVEAU"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:182
msgid "Summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter04.rst:184
msgid ""
"Administrators can manage the tenant-wide offline policy related to team "
"folders and users. In the case where team folder size is small and user "
"size is small, an administrator can enable the offline flag to push files"
" and folders to user's devices."
msgstr "Administratorer kan administrere den lejeromfattende offlinepolitik relateret til teammapper og brugere. I tilfælde hvor teammappens størrelse er lille og brugerstørrelsen er lille, kan en administrator aktivere offlineflaget for at skubbe filer og mapper til brugernes enheder."

#: ../../chapter04.rst:186
msgid ""
"However, in the case where the team folder size is big and the user "
"number is not small, we recommend the administrator enables as few "
"offline flags/settings as possible on the administration side. Users can "
"still do offline management themselves within their working folder on a "
"case-by-case basis."
msgstr "Dog i tilfælde af, at teammappens størrelse er stor og antallet af brugere ikke er lille, anbefaler vi, at administratoren aktiverer så få offlineflag/indstillinger som muligt på administrationssiden. Brugerne kan stadig selv administrere offline inden for deres arbejdsmappe på et sag-for-sag grundlag."

